      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3177896699",
      "Source": "You can use this Flute to tame yourself a Gigantophis!<#RN#><#RN#>Taming Instructions: <#RN#><#RN#>1). Play this flute at a decent distance away from a Gigantophis. (Far enough so it doesn't attack you) <#RN#><#RN#>2). Once the \"Play Note\" Progress box is Green it will start to calm Gigantophis and start the taming process. (This is shown by a taming Icon appearing as well as Gigantophis swaying it's head)<#RN#><#RN#>3). Once the process is started, Gigantophis will approah you, and grab you, let it do this.<#RN#><#RN#>4). Once you are grabbed by Gigantophis you will then have to play the flute notes depending on the shape it draws with it's head. <#RN#><#RN#>- The Shape is randomized every 10 seconds and is shown by a progress bar which is visibly shown.<#RN#><#RN#>6). Play the correct note until the timer ends, which if done successfully will add taming progress. <#RN#><#RN#>Then just repeat until tamed.<#RN#><#RN#>NOTE You can unequip the flute and punch Gigantophis to force it to release you if wanted.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以用这支笛子给自己驯服一条巨蟒！<#RN#>驯服说明：<#RN#>1.在离巨蟒适当距离处吹奏这支笛子。（距离要足够远，以免它攻击你）<#RN#>2.一旦 “吹奏音符” 进度条变为绿色，巨蟒就会开始平静下来<#RN#>驯服过程随之开始（此时会出现一个驯服图标，同时巨蟒会摆动头部）<#RN#>3.驯服过程开启后，巨蟒会靠近你并抓住你，让它这么做。<#RN#>4.被巨蟒抓住后，你要根据它头部画出的形状吹奏笛子音符。<#RN#>形状每 10 秒随机变化一次，会通过一个可见的进度条显示。<#RN#>5.吹奏正确的音符，直到计时结束。如果吹奏成功，会增加驯服进度。<#RN#>然后重复以上步骤，直至成功驯服。<#RN#>注意：如果需要，你可以卸下笛子并击打巨蟒，迫使它放开你。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2260682087",
      "Source": "SearchBox",
      "Trans": {"SC":"搜索框","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1642186916",
